      "heading": "Strong product, wrong customer",
      "text": "SafetyCulture's template depth, analytics and integrations are genuinely best in class. They are also built for enterprise quality managers with IT teams and per-seat budgets. For a 10-person UK field firm, those same strengths become friction: per-seat pricing with no ceiling, an app and login every engineer must adopt, and configuration complexity that needs an owner. Most small firms use a fraction of the features and pay for all of them."
